{"4565400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Samurai Fighters Together", "steam_appid": 4565400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honor is as sharp as your blade.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a stylized world inspired by feudal Japan and take on the role of a samurai fighting to survive and master the art of combat. This experience combines both PvE and PvP, where your reflexes, timing, and strategy define your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wave-Based Survival (PvE)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly difficult waves of enemies. Each wave grows more intense, pushing your skills and decision-making to the limit. Positioning, timing, and resource management are key to staying alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitive Combat (PvP)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players in skill-based duels. Outsmart and outplay your opponents with precise timing and disciplined combat. Only the strongest samurai will prevail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fluid and Skill-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike matters. Easy to learn, difficult to master combat mechanics designed to deliver a satisfying and responsive experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stylized World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted low-poly world inspired by Japanese architecture, nature, and atmosphere.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your blade, stand your ground, and prove how long you can survive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honor is as sharp as your blade.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a stylized world inspired by feudal Japan and take on the role of a samurai fighting to survive and master the art of combat. This experience combines both PvE and PvP, where your reflexes, timing, and strategy define your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wave-Based Survival (PvE)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly diffi